      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "On prima facie reading of the prayers in the plaint, it appears that the essential relief sought by the plaintiffs is claim of compensation arising out of rights conferred by the National Highways Act,\n1956.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 608,
      "end": 816,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "National Highways Act,\n1956",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 788,
          "end": 815
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Therefore, it is necessary to consider Section 20(xv) which exempts payment of court fees in relation to acquisition of land for public purposes other than items covered by Schedule-I, Entry 15 of the Bombay Court Fees Act, 1959.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 817,
      "end": 1046,
      "entities": [
